    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>Dear Dr Pornprasertmanit and all,</p><p>I am one of newbees of the simsem package.</p><p>When I use simsem to do a simulation like the below, I am bit confused by pValue() function.</p><p>I know p is the proportion of the number of replications that provide poorer fit (e.g., less CFI value or greater RMSEA value) than the analysis result from the observed data.</p><p>Does it mean that the data-fitted model is reliable if p are very small such as &lt;0.05? </p><p>Is the smaller the P value the better data-fitted model?</p><p>OR just inverse?</p><p>Should I need to look at parameter coverages and powers as well?</p><p>Yong</p><p><br></p><table style=\"color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px;border-collapse:collapse;box-sizing:border-box\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\">library(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">simsem</span>)</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\">library(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">lavaan</span>)</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\"><br></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">HS.model</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(215,58,73);box-sizing:border-box\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(3,47,98);box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span> visual  =~ x1 + x2 + x3</span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:rgb(3,47,98);box-sizing:border-box\">              textual =~ x4 + x5 + x6</span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:rgb(3,47,98);box-sizing:border-box\">              speed   =~ x7 + x8 + x9 <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\"><br></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">fit</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(215,58,73);box-sizing:border-box\">&lt;-</span> cfa(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">HS.model</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(227,98,9);box-sizing:border-box\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(215,58,73);box-sizing:border-box\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">HolzingerSwineford1939</span>)</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\"><br></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output.nomis</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(215,58,73);box-sizing:border-box\">&lt;-</span> sim(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,92,197);box-sizing:border-box\">1000</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(227,98,9);box-sizing:border-box\">n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(215,58,73);box-sizing:border-box\">=</span>nrow(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">HolzingerSwineford1939</span>), <span style=\"color:rgb(227,98,9);box-sizing:border-box\">model</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(215,58,73);box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">fit</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(227,98,9);box-sizing:border-box\">generate</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(215,58,73);box-sizing:border-box\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">fit</span>)</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\">plotCutoff(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output.nomis</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(0,92,197);box-sizing:border-box\">0.05</span>)</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;width:50px;text-align:right;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);line-height:20px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;min-width:50px;box-sizing:border-box\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;line-height:20px;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;box-sizing:border-box\">pValue(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">fit</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output.nomis</span>)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
